Files adapted from Deephaven carry the header comment
"Adapted from @deephaven/grid (Apache-2.0), web-client-ui 0bab596" and were
modified: tree rows, data bars, links and token boxes, cell editing and paste,
row and column moving, row resizing, the accessibility fallback, and the mock
models were removed; @deephaven/utils, lodash.clamp, memoizee and color-convert
were replaced with small local helpers; the theme was rewritten.
